<root><xsd:schema id="root" xmlns="" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:msdata="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:xml-msdata" /><data name="Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>About Us</value></data><data name="Welcome" xml:space="preserve"><value>Welcome to Community Finder</value></data><data name="AboutApp" xml:space="preserve"><value>About the App</value></data><data name="AboutAppText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Community Finder is a modern platform designed to help users discover courses, events, and communities that match their personal interests. Our smart recommendation system leverages AI to suggest content based on your browsing habits, favorites, and engagement, while fully respecting your privacy.</value></data><data name="CoreFeatures" xml:space="preserve"><value>Core Features</value></data><data name="Feature1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Browse a wide variety of courses and events tailored to your interests</value></data><data name="Feature2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Join chat groups to connect with like-minded users</value></data><data name="Feature3" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Register for events easily and securely</value></data><data name="Feature4" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Track your participation and rewards for completed tasks</value></data><data name="Feature5" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Access a detailed history of your activities</value></data><data name="Feature6" xml:space="preserve"><value>• AI-powered personalized recommendations based on interaction data</value></data><data name="Feature7" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Admins can manage events, review statistics, and generate reports</value></data><data name="Privacy" xml:space="preserve"><value>Privacy &amp; Data Protection</value></data><data name="PrivacyIntro" xml:space="preserve"><value>At Community Finder, protecting your personal information is our top priority. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and safeguard your data.</value></data><data name="DataCollection" xml:space="preserve"><value>Data Collection</value></data><data name="DataCollect1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• We collect information you provide during registration, such as email and password.</value></data><data name="DataCollect2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• We also track your course browsing, favorites, and event participation to provide personalized recommendations.</value></data><data name="DataCollect3" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Data collection is limited to what is necessary for the core functionalities of the app.</value></data><data name="DataUsage" xml:space="preserve"><value>Data Usage</value></data><data name="DataUsage1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Personal data is used to authenticate your account, provide services, and deliver personalized content.</value></data><data name="DataUsage2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Anonymized data may be used for improving AI recommendation algorithms.</value></data><data name="DataUsage3" xml:space="preserve"><value>• We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties without your consent.</value></data><data name="DataSecurity" xml:space="preserve"><value>Data Security</value></data><data name="DataSecurity1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• All personal data is encrypted in transit and at rest.</value></data><data name="DataSecurity2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Access to user data is strictly controlled and monitored.</value></data><data name="DataSecurity3" xml:space="preserve"><value>• We implement industry-standard measures to protect against unauthorized access, alteration, or deletion.</value></data><data name="UserRights" xml:space="preserve"><value>User Rights</value></data><data name="UserRights1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Users can request access, correction, or deletion of their personal information.</value></data><data name="UserRights2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• You can opt out of AI-based personalized recommendations at any time.</value></data><data name="UserRights3" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Users are informed about all data collection practices and changes to privacy policies.</value></data><data name="Compliance" xml:space="preserve"><value>Compliance</value></data><data name="Compliance1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• We comply with GDPR and relevant local privacy regulations.</value></data><data name="Compliance2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Any breach of data privacy will be promptly reported and addressed according to legal requirements.</value></data><data name="Terms" xml:space="preserve"><value>Terms of Use</value></data><data name="TermsIntro" xml:space="preserve"><value>By using Community Finder, you agree to abide by the following rules:</value></data><data name="Terms1" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Keep your account secure &amp; do not share login credentials.</value></data><data name="Terms2" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Respect other users and their contributions in chats and events.</value></data><data name="Terms3" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Ensure any content you submit complies with laws &amp; does not infringe on third-party rights.</value></data><data name="Terms4" xml:space="preserve"><value>• The app is provided as-is, and we are not liable for external content or user-generated data.</value></data><data name="Terms5" xml:space="preserve"><value>• Violations may result in account suspension or termination.</value></data><data name="Star" xml:space="preserve"><value>🌟</value></data><data name="Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Reports and Alerts (Admin)</value></data><data name="AllReportsLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>All Reports</value></data><data name="Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Course Detail</value></data><data name="DateAndTimeLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>Date &amp; Time</value></data><data name="PriceLabel" xml:space="preserve"><value>Price</value></data><data name="BookNowButton" xml:space="preserve"><value>Book now</value></data><data nam